                a safe harbor (2G – Federal Poverty Line or 2H – Rate of Pay).
            `);

            $('#riskDefense').html(`
                The employee was full-time and did not receive an offer of
                minimum essential coverage for ${riskMonths.length} month(s).
                No safe harbor protection applies under IRC §4980H(b).
